File Handling in Python

File handling is used to:
Read files
Write files
Append data
Process logs/reports

Very important for interviews.

Opening a File
Syntax:
open(filename, mode)

Example:
file = open("test.txt", "r")

File Modes:
Mode	Meaning
r	    Read
w	    Write (overwrite)
a	    Append
x	    Create new file
rb	    Read binary
wb	    Write binary